Centres for Disease Control</publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing Interests: </bold>The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn><fn fn-type="financial-disclosure"><p><bold>Funding: </bold>The MDR-TB program is funded primarily by M&#x000e9;decins Sans Fronti&#x000e8;res, Holland, with contributions in kind from the Ministry of Health in Karakalpakstan and the National Reference Center for Mycobacteria in Germany. All the authors are connected to these three organisations, with the exception of the principal author who is currently employed elsewhere.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>